     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">There will be several R talks in this session including terra (for spatial raster data), caladaptR (for climate data), and Shiny with geospatial data.  Join us!  Register early – it takes the system a minute\r\n to send the zoom link.  More details below.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Best,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Geospatial Data Specialist<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">DataLab: Data Science &amp; Informatics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Data &amp; Digital Scholarship<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">370 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">ORCID: </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,serif;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465179335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2n65ftHQ1Qv6o83CiHqB9i\">0000-0002-2954-8710</a>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geospatia...@ucdavis.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geospatia...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Michele M Tobias<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, May 17, 2021 8:23 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> geospatial Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geosp...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geospatial] #maptimeDavis Lightning Talks<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">TOMORROW! This is the last session of the school year! Come learn about what our community has been working on and thinking about!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u></u> <u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>#MAPTIMEDAVIS: LIGHTNING TALKS<u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>MAY 18 @ 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM<u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Description: </b>In this session, you’ll hear from a variety of researchers about their work with geospatial data and mapping in a series of 5-7 minute talks. Topics include tools and packages for R (Shiny and terra), working with cloud-optimized\r\n geotiffs, working in the Delta, landscape connectivity, and more!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Learning Objectives:</b> Participants will learn about a variety of research projects and methods.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Prerequisites: None</b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Software: None</b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Instructor:</b> Evlyn Pless<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Instructor Bio: </b>Evlyn Pless is a postdoctoral scholar in Anthropology.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Location: </b>Zoom. Please register to receive Zoom link.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Registration: </b><a href=\"https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/MaptimeLightningTalks/register/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/MaptimeLightningTalks/register/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465179335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3dhDtEOeZrdnf7OkpT4pPz\">https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/MaptimeLightningTalks/register/</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Cost:</b> Free of charge.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>More Upcoming #maptimeDavis Events: </b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">May 18, 2021 <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/maptimedavis-lightning-talks/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/maptimedavis-lightning-talks/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465179335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1CH2dbRXj7MvmChMdTjrAG\">\r\nLightning Talks</a> - Evlyn Pless (Organizer) &amp; the Community<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">*** The full schedule with links to each event is on the <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465179335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1O9ngOECZp31ztfxVN6wtw\">\r\nSpatial Sciences Research &amp; Learning Cluster</a> page. ***<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Whenever possible, #maptimeDavis Workshops will be recorded and posted on the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTooXK1RiSHNbWsmeqz0W6g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTooXK1RiSHNbWsmeqz0W6g&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465179335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Zi3JHszkiVwXyDTicldrj\">DataLab YouTube channel</a>. #maptimeDavis Studio will not be recorded to encourage open discussion.\r\n Weekly reminders will be sent on the <a href=\"https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465179335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0croHbqPFSExzmYbNU68tY\">Geospatial Email List</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">#maptimeDavis Workshops and Studio are a product of UC Davis DataLab’s <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465179335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1O9ngOECZp31ztfxVN6wtw\">Spatial Sciences Research Cluster</a> and are supported by the contributions and participation of our community.\r\n Please send questions to Michele Tobias <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Geospatial Data Specialist<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">DataLab: Data Science &amp; Informatics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Data &amp; Digital Scholarship<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">370 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">ORCID: </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,serif;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465179335000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2n65ftHQ1Qv6o83CiHqB9i\">0000-0002-2954-8710</a>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
